---
import PublicLayout from "../layouts/PublicLayout.astro";
---

<PublicLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for Late Diagnosed.">
  <main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
    <h1 class="font-heading text-5xl text-[#1e2a5e] mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-8">Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <section class="space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Late Diagnosed respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains what information we may collect, how we use it, and how we protect it.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        This website offers optional user accounts authenticated by Okta. Okta is the source of truth for account identity and access. When you sign in, we receive account identifiers and profile fields such as your name, email address, username, and assigned groups or permissions. Late Diagnosed does not receive or store your Okta password.
      </p>

      <p>
        If you contact us by email or send us a story, we may receive your email address and any information you choose to include.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">Story Submissions</h2>
      <p>
        The Tell Your Story page asks only for your story and an optional name or nickname. If you leave the name field blank, the story is marked for anonymous credit.
      </p>

      <p>
        The page currently prepares an email for you to review and send to Late Diagnosed. The website does not save your story to a Late Diagnosed website database before you send that email. Your email address is received as part of the email you send.
      </p>

      <p>
        The story form includes a required permission checkbox. By selecting it, you give Late Diagnosed permission to use, edit for length or clarity, and share the submitted story in our nonprofit website, social media, educational materials, awareness, fundraising, and other communications. You continue to own your story.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        Late Diagnosed may use Google Analytics or similar analytics tools to understand general website usage, improve resources, and evaluate public interest in our educational content.
      </p>

      <p>
        Analytics tools may collect information such as pages visited, approximate location, browser type, device type, referral source, and general usage patterns. This information is used to understand website activity and improve the website.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        The website uses encrypted, HTTP-only cookies to complete sign-in and maintain your account session. Analytics tools may also use cookies or similar technologies. Late Diagnosed does not currently use advertising cookies or behavioral advertising.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">Newsletter</h2>
      <p>
        Late Diagnosed does not currently operate a direct newsletter signup system. If a newsletter tool is added in the future, this policy will be updated to describe how that service handles information.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">Donations</h2>
      <p>
        Late Diagnosed expects to accept donations through a third-party donation or payment processor. Donation processors may collect information such as name, email address, billing information, payment details, donation amount, and transaction records.
      </p>

      <p>
        Late Diagnosed does not intend to directly store full payment card information on this website. When a donation processor is selected, this policy will be updated to identify the provider and explain how donor information is handled.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">How We Use Information</h2>
      <p>
        We use information you provide only to respond to inquiries, provide requested information, use submitted stories as permitted by the contributor, improve our resources, evaluate website performance, process or administer future donations, and support the nonprofit mission of Late Diagnosed.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">Information Sharing</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell personal information. We may share information only when necessary to operate the website, process donations, comply with law, protect the organization, respond to your request, or use a submitted story in the ways you permitted when submitting it.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">Third-Party Links and Services</h2>
      <p>
        This website may link to third-party websites or use third-party services. Late Diagnosed is not responsible for the privacy practices, policies, or content of those websites or services.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl text-[#1e2a5e]">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this Privacy Policy may be sent to <a class="text-[#1e2a5e] underline" href="mailto:info@latediagnosed.org">info@latediagnosed.org</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</PublicLayout>
